---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import FinalCTA from '../components/FinalCTA.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About DataDecision — Founder-led, method-first"
  description="DataDecision is a founder-led, measurement-first growth partner focused on AI-search visibility, measurement foundations and scoped implementation."
  path="/about/"
  schema={{
    '@context': 'https://schema.org',
    '@type': 'AboutPage',
    name: 'About DataDecision',
    mainEntity: { '@type': 'Organization', name: 'DataDecision' },
  }}
>
  <Breadcrumbs items={[{ label: 'Home', href: '/' }, { label: 'About' }]} />
  <header class="shell page-hero page-hero--compact">
    <div class="page-hero__copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">About DataDecision</p><h1>
        Founder-led. Method-first. Built in public.
      </h1><p class="lede">
        A focused consultancy for B2B SaaS teams that need a defensible view of AI-search visibility
        and the measurement path into pipeline.
      </p>
    </div><aside class="page-hero__aside">
      <div class="folio"><span>Company description</span><span>01 line</span></div><p
        class="lede"
        style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:1.8rem;"
      >
        Focused on AI-search visibility, measurement foundations and scoped implementation.
      </p>
    </aside>
  </header>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="shell editorial-grid">
      <div class="section-intro">
        <p class="eyebrow">Why this exists</p><h2>Evidence should survive the handoff.</h2>
      </div><div>
        <p class="lede">
          DataDecision begins with a simple operating belief: the method, assumptions and limits
          should travel with every marketing number. That matters more as discovery moves across
          search pages, generated answers, review sources and private conversations that no single
          dashboard can fully observe.
        </p><p class="measure">
          The firm is being built from the measurement layer outward. Its launch offer is
          intentionally narrower than a full-service growth agency, because capability should be
          demonstrated before it is advertised.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section section--bright">
    <div class="shell editorial-grid">
      <div class="section-intro">
        <p class="eyebrow">Operating principles</p><h2>How the work is judged.</h2>
      </div><div class="rule-list">
        <div class="rule-row">
          <span class="mono">01</span><div>
            <h3>Evidence over adjectives</h3><p>
              Describe the method and observation before describing the outcome.
            </p>
          </div><span class="rule-row__meta">Claim discipline</span>
        </div><div class="rule-row">
          <span class="mono">02</span><div>
            <h3>Baselines before bravado</h3><p>
              Define the starting record before proposing a change.
            </p>
          </div><span class="rule-row__meta">Comparability</span>
        </div><div class="rule-row">
          <span class="mono">03</span><div>
            <h3>Method in public</h3><p>
              Publish the rules needed to interrogate a number without disclosing private client
              data.
            </p>
          </div><span class="rule-row__meta">Transparency</span>
        </div><div class="rule-row">
          <span class="mono">04</span><div>
            <h3>Uncertainty stays visible</h3><p>
              Unknown, unavailable and ambiguous are separate states—not inconvenient zeros.
            </p>
          </div><span class="rule-row__meta">Honesty</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section section--ink">
    <div class="shell editorial-grid">
      <div class="section-intro">
        <p class="eyebrow" style="color:#9fd2bc;">What is not claimed</p><h2>No borrowed scale.</h2>
      </div><div>
        <p class="lede" style="color:#d3d6d1;">
          The launch site does not claim clients, logos, testimonials, partners, offices, headcount,
          awards, proprietary datasets or guaranteed placements. Founder identity and verifiable
          credentials will be added after the final factual record is approved—not filled with
          generic biography copy.
        </p><div class="annotation" style="margin-top:2rem;color:var(--ink);">
          <span class="evidence-label">Current truth</span><p>
            Founder-led delivery. Focused launch scope. Public method. Demonstration research
            clearly labelled.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <FinalCTA heading="Start with a question the evidence can answer." />
</BaseLayout>
